<title>FINLAND: Orion says Prihti to leave.</title>
<headline>Orion says Prihti to leave.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion Oy said in a statement on Monday president and CEO Aatto Prihti would leave the company to join the Finnish National Fund for Research and Development (SITRA) on January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;He will release his above mentioned duties at Orion, and join SITRA as from January 1, 1997,&quot; Orion said.  </p>
<p>Prihti had been named president of SITRA, it said.</p>
<p>Orion did not give more details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
